<title>UK: New Frontier sets 20 bln yen bond due June 2000.</title>
<headline>New Frontier sets 20 bln yen bond due June 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dual-currency bond was announced by lead manager Kokusai.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEW FRONTIER LTD</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.32	MATURITY    02.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL CURRENCY ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI ANN</p>
<p> EXP S&amp;P    AAA	 DENOMS (K) 500	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  1.65	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SECURED BY U.S. TREASURY NOTES</p>
<p>		REDEMPTION IN U.S. DOLLARS AT $3,977.72 PER 500,000</p>
<p>		YEN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
